The air quality observations and forecasts come from the AirNow program of the
U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (https://www.airnow.gov), through the
AirNow API (https://docs.airnowapi.org). They are provided by federal, state,
local and tribal air quality agencies, which own the data; they are
preliminary, not fully verified or validated, and are shown as received, with
their agency, following the AirNow Data Exchange Guidelines.

The files under test/fixtures are answers of the AirNow API captured on
2026-09-09 by the authors of the R package airnow
(https://github.com/briandconnelly/airnow, MIT licence).

This community integration is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by
the U.S. EPA or the AirNow program.
